<p>Furthermore, evaluation in highly optimized serving frameworks like <strong>SGLang</strong> shows throughput increases of up to 17% on Qwen3-30B-A3B-Thinking, proving that the theoretical improvements in accepted length translate directly into practical deployment-time gains.</p>
